WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.173
The fictional original design requires every customer to use the online form.

00:00:05.173 --> 00:00:12.934
Reviewing the customer's experience reveals a risk: an unfamiliar or interrupted form can block access to the service.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:21.125
The revised proposal keeps a staff-assisted route, clearer wording and a visible correction request before the summary moves forward.

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:25.005
Record the change as proposed, not approved or tested.

00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:27.592
The service manager owns route approval.

00:00:27.592 --> 00:00:34.490
The front-desk lead invites a walkthrough using fictional information and reports what changed after the feedback.

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.077
The service reviewer owns summary correction.

00:00:37.077 --> 00:00:43.112
Practical support includes a way to resume or receive assistance without unnecessary personal disclosure.

00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:52.166
Save the before-and-after decision, its reason, the human owners and the open questions in the people section of the adoption plan.
